### Advanced Binding Types

**Self-Owned Receivers**
```cpp
mojo::Remote<db::mojom::Logger> logger;
mojo::MakeSelfOwnedReceiver(std::make_unique<LoggerImpl>(),
                           logger.BindNewPipeAndPassReceiver());
